<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For additional information, contact <a href="mailto:agriff14@utk.edu" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Andrew Griffith</a> or <a href="mailto:bowling10@utk.edu" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Becky Bowling</a>.</p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-3 kt-pane527_8b03b7-00"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title">Forage Budgets</span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://arec.tennessee.edu/forage-budgets-calculator/">Forage Budget Calculator</a> (Excel)</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://solutions.tennessee.edu/publication/D252A/">Tennessee Forage Budget Calculator</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://solutions.tennessee.edu/publication/D252C/">2025 Tennessee Hay Budgets</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://solutions.tennessee.edu/publication/D252D/">2025 Tennessee Pasture Budgets</a></p>



